Package: xiaomi-cam
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: genosajd <genosajd@gmail.com>
Depends: ffmpeg, libc6, libgl1, libx11-6, libxext6, libwayland-client0
Recommends: xdg-user-dirs
Section: video
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/genosajd/xiaomi-pc-view
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Description: Xiaomi Mi Home camera viewer
 Desktop app to watch and control Xiaomi Mi Home cameras (e.g. Outdoor Camera
 CW700S) from Linux: live video up to 2.5K from any network, pan/tilt, camera
 zoom, points, spotlight, siren, SD card history, MP4 recording, camera grid,
 AI tasks with notifications, MCP server and local HTTP API.
